WEBVTT

00:01:29.711 --> 00:01:32.519
building alliances
with other political actors.

00:01:32.543 --> 00:01:34.874
(Laughter)

00:01:34.898 --> 00:01:38.988
And I even once tried to jeopardize
the political process.

00:01:39.012 --> 00:01:40.012
(Laughter)

00:01:41.077 --> 00:01:45.720
These meetings sound very peaceful,
civil and democratic, right?

00:01:46.421 --> 00:01:48.422
But that was not always the case.

00:01:48.446 --> 00:01:53.231
Because of this open, free space
to talk, discuss and criticize,

00:01:53.255 --> 00:01:55.865
things sometimes got really heated.

00:01:56.529 --> 00:01:59.212
One meeting went really bad for me.

00:01:59.236 --> 00:02:01.303
I was about 10 years old at that time,